{
"recipe_id":"18 Custard-Based Homemade Ice Cream",
"source_text":"1. 将 3 个鸡蛋的蛋清和蛋黄分离，只保留蛋黄。\n2. 将蛋黄打散，加入 20g 白砂糖和去籽柠檬汁，搅拌均匀。\n3. 250g 牛奶小火加热至微微冒泡，煮开后立即关火。\n4. 趁热将牛奶少量、多次缓慢加入蛋黄液中，同时不断搅拌。\n5. 将混合好的蛋奶液重新倒入锅中，加入少许盐。\n6. 全程小火加热并不断搅拌，直至蛋奶液变得黏稠，随后放凉。\n7. 300g 淡奶油打发至酸奶状。\n8. 将打发后的淡奶油与冷却的蛋奶液混合均匀。\n9. 倒入容器，放入冰箱冷冻。",
"text_steps":[{"id": "S001", "text": "将 3 个鸡蛋的蛋清和蛋黄分离", "text_en": "Separate the whites and yolks of 3 eggs.", "start_char": 3, "end_char": 18, "node_indices": [1, 2, 3], "edge_indices": [1, 2], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 1, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 1, "edge_index": 2, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 2, "edge_index": 1, "role": "output"}, {"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 2, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S002", "text": "只保留蛋黄", "text_en": "Keep only the egg yolks.", "start_char": 19, "end_char": 24, "node_indices": [3, 4], "edge_indices": [3], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 3, "edge_index": 3, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 3, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S003", "text": "将蛋黄打散", "text_en": "Beat the egg yolks to break them up.", "start_char": 29, "end_char": 34, "node_indices": [4, 5], "edge_indices": [4], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 4, "edge_index": 4, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 4, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S004", "text": "加入 20g 白砂糖", "text_en": "Add 20 g of white sugar.", "start_char": 35, "end_char": 45, "node_indices": [5, 6], "edge_indices": [5], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 6, "edge_index": 5, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 5, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S005", "text": "加入 20g 白砂糖和去籽柠檬汁", "text_en": "Add deseeded lemon juice along with the 20 g of white sugar.", "start_char": 35, "end_char": 51, "node_indices": [5, 7], "edge_indices": [6], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 7, "edge_index": 6, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 6, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S006", "text": "搅拌均匀", "text_en": "Stir until evenly mixed.", "start_char": 52, "end_char": 56, "node_indices": [5, 8], "edge_indices": [7], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 5, "edge_index": 7, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 7, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S007", "text": "250g 牛奶小火加热至微微冒泡", "text_en": "Heat 250 g of milk over low heat until it begins to bubble slightly.", "start_char": 61, "end_char": 77, "node_indices": [9, 10, 11], "edge_indices": [8, 9], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 9, "edge_index": 8, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 8, "role": "receiver"}, {"node_index": 10, "edge_index": 9, "role": "environment"}, {"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 9, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S008", "text": "煮开后立即关火", "text_en": "Bring it to a boil, then immediately turn off the heat.", "start_char": 78, "end_char": 85, "node_indices": [11, 12], "edge_indices": [10], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 11, "edge_index": 10, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 10, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S009", "text": "趁热将牛奶少量、多次缓慢加入蛋黄液中", "text_en": "While it is hot, slowly add the milk to the yolk mixture in small amounts over several additions.", "start_char": 90, "end_char": 108, "node_indices": [8, 12], "edge_indices": [11], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 12, "edge_index": 11, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 11, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S010", "text": "同时不断搅拌", "text_en": "Stir continuously at the same time.", "start_char": 109, "end_char": 115, "node_indices": [8, 13], "edge_indices": [12], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 8, "edge_index": 12, "role": "input"}, {"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 12, "role": "output"}]}, {"id": "S011", "text": "将混合好的蛋奶液重新倒入锅中", "text_en": "Pour the mixed egg-and-milk mixture back into the pot.", "start_char": 120, "end_char": 134, "node_indices": [13, 14], "edge_indices": [13], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 13, "edge_index": 13, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 13, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S012", "text": "加入少许盐", "text_en": "Add a little salt.", "start_char": 135, "end_char": 140, "node_indices": [14, 15], "edge_indices": [14], "node_action_pairs": [{"node_index": 15, "edge_index": 14, "role": "source"}, {"node_index": 14, "edge_index": 14, "role": "receiver"}]}, {"id": "S013",